C, Fagerstrom K</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Patterns and predictors of smoking cessation in the general population</article-title><source>Progress in respiratory research: the tobacco epidemic</source><year>1997</year><publisher-name>Basel: S Karger AG</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Acheson</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><source>Independent inquiry into inequalities in health report</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>London. HMSO</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bauld</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Chesterman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Judge</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Pound</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Coleman</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Impact of UK National Health Service smoking cessation services: variations in outcomes in England</article-title><source>EESCS Tobacco Control</source><year>2003</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>296</fpage><lpage>301</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/tc.12.3.296</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vieu</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dodhia</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gulliford</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Health equity audit profile of stop smoking services in Lambeth &#x02013; implications for service uptake and utilisation</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>Lambeth PCT. London</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>North East Publ